~ start_shop
set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty = 0
Merchant: Welcome! I have the most finest seeds in Harvestia.
- Open Shop
	=> buy_menu
- Leave
	Merchant: Come again!!
=> END

~ buy_menu

Merchant: What seeds do you need?

- Carrot Seeds (35 Gold each)
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "carrot_seeds"
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 35
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_tool_enum = "PlantCarrot"
	=> buy_qty_select

- Tomato Seeds
	=> tomato_menu

- Back to Main Menu
	=> start_shop

~ tomato_menu

if SeedUnlockManager.is_seed_unlocked("pumpkin_seeds"):
	Merchant: Pumpkin Seeds cost 40 Gold each.

	- Buy Tomato Seeds
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "pumpkin_seeds"
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 40
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_tool_enum = "PlantPumpkin"
		=> buy_qty_select

	- Back
		=> buy_menu

else:
	Merchant: Sorry, Tomato Seeds are still locked.
	Merchant: Keep progressing through Harvestia and they will become available.

	- Back
		=> buy_menu

~ buy_qty_select
Merchant: How many would you like? (Current: {{InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty}}) | Total Cost: {{InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty * InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price}} Gold
- Add +1 Item
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty += 1
	=> buy_qty_select
- Add +5 Items
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty += 5
	=> buy_qty_select
- Remove -1 Item
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty -= 1
	=> buy_qty_select
- Remove -5 Items
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty -= 5
	=> buy_qty_select
- Purchase
	if InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty > 0 and InventoryManager.current_shop.buy_seeds(InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type, DataTypes.Tools[InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_tool_enum], InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price, InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty):
		Merchant: Excellent! New Seeds Added.
	else:
		Merchant: Sorry, the transaction failed!
	=> start_shop
- Cancel
	=> buy_menu
